#!/usr/bin/env node
// Claude Code PreToolUse guard, three duties, in this order:
//  - a file tool (Edit, Write, NotebookEdit) aimed at a path one of an active
//    pack's skills names under `force-load-on-file-edits-paths` — or any tool
